From: "Francesco \"Dil3mm4\" Manzo" <dil3mm4.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:31:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add per-title virtual clock with restart and continuous modes

Expose a per-title monotonic-progressing wall clock for Mac app builds. Keep steady-clock APIs and legacy DM_FIXED_TIME behavior intact. The launcher stores mode, start date and session anchor in the existing player env.txt.

Upstream-Status: pending

Reason: Experimental per-title wall-clock override awaiting upstream coordination and real-game validation

Issue: pending LNPANDY/NX2Apple virtual-clock feature proposal (not yet filed)
